// Regedit as Trusted Installer | T1548 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_regedit_trustedinstaller.yml
DeviceProcessEvents
| where FolderPath endswith "\\regedit.exe" and (InitiatingProcessFolderPath endswith "\\TrustedInstaller.exe" or InitiatingProcessFolderPath endswith "\\ProcessHacker.exe")
